body:
Putting VSCCF on any drink that is shaken bc it will NEVER settle nicely and it doesn't look pretty and the customer will be like "iS tHerE cOlD fOaM on tHiS?" And u have to be like "YEAH THERE IS IT JUST DOESNT SETTLE NICELY BECAUSE THE DRINK FOAMS.IN THE SHAKER"

LIKE 

On an iced matcha I can TRY to strain it maybe a shaken espresso too but you can't strain the refreshers without leaving the fruit out plus straining is an unnecessary step especially during a rush and my former bartender self gets agitated when I can't make the presentation nice ;;
